# Daniel asked, on 2026-11-10, for depot's atuin on Debian; this entry is how
# (scripts/lib.sh, overrides_debian). His merge of the PR approves the mechanism.
# Debian 13 ships atuin 18.6.1, and machines pin depot below Debian's packages,
# so a plain install would take Debian's. This line makes install-test.sh pin
# depot's atuin above Debian's, as a machine does that lists atuin as an
# exception. A machine that does not list it keeps Debian's atuin.
override debian
